  "title": "Think Beyond the Now",
  "description": "When tempted by immediate rewards: - Pause: Ask yourself, \"What will this choice feel like in a week?\" - Compare payoffs: Imagine both short- and long-term benefits. Write them down if it helps. - Set a delay: Commit to waiting a set amount of time (e.g., 10 minutes, an hour) before deciding. Example: Craving junk food? Picture how you’ll feel after eating it versus sticking to your health goal.",
